msgid ""
"を得る。例えば温度と有効質量を固定すると、ギャップが大きいほど熱励起された "
"キャリアの密度は指数関数的に小さくなる。実測の伝導率には移動度の温度依存も入る。 "
"ドーピングがあれば電子と正孔の密度は一般に異なり、複数のバンドや谷が寄与する場合は 各状態密度を足して計算する。"
msgstr ""
"If the temperature and effective masses are held fixed, for example, the "
"density of thermally excited carriers decreases exponentially as the gap "
"grows. The measured conductivity also reflects the temperature dependence"
" of the mobilities. With doping, the electron and hole densities "
"generally differ. If several bands or valleys contribute, include the "
"density of states of each in the sum."

